Subject: [PATCH] Add the DS Rumble Pak

A Rumble Pak in the GBA slot rumbles when the player takes damage,
longer for more damage, whatever hurt: the health of the player's sprite
is watched while playing. Firing a weapon rumbles too, the shotgun and
RPG longer. The pak only moves while it is switched back and forth, a
tick task does that at 60 Hz for as long as the rumble lasts. Without a
pak, and on the DSi which has no GBA slot, nothing changes. The demos
playing behind the menu don't rumble.

Game Options has Rumble On/Off below Adult Mode, kept as Rumble in the
config, it rumbles once turned on.
