@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 //
-// Nintendo DS buttons
+// Nintendo DS buttons and Rumble Pak
 //
 // The buttons send PC scancodes: while playing the keys of the game
 // functions they stand for (the default key setup, which the game always
@@ -9,7 +9,8 @@
 // The scancode sent on press is kept, so the release always matches even if
 // a menu opened or closed in between. Also where the console sleeps while
